{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n最新一集《女神配對計劃 2》爆出驚人發展！陳星妤（Yvette）突然行使特權換入李爾晨（Kyle），竟意外觸發二人塵封多年的虐心關係。對話期間Yvette更激動爆喊，Kyle亦感觸落淚，這段「友達以上」的遺憾過往，究竟隱藏著怎樣不為人知的故事？\n</p>\n<h2>Yvette換人Kyle扮嬲追問 關係曝光全場嘩然</h2>\n<p>在水上遊戲環節後，勝出的Yvette獲得與Oswald單獨約會的福利，以及一個「換人權」。她毅然決定將Kyle換入自己組，令Kyle大感不解，並在傾偈環節中扮嬲追問：「你做咩叫我過嚟？」Yvette解釋本來就想選他，只是礙於順序未能如願。在場的Carman及Step即時嗅到八卦氣味，追問二人如何認識，Yvette平淡回應：「我哋係咁啱 Agency 有個類似嘅 Gathering，你知啦，男仔鍾意識吓女仔好正常。」沒想到Kyle竟拋出震撼直球：「但我淨係識你咋喎！」此話一出令全場嘩然，氣氛瞬間變得曖昧又緊張。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_1501582786ae804a081c73.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_1501582786ae804a081c73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Yvette激動爆喊剖白心聲 「所有愛情都係脆弱」</h2>\n<p>在眾人「撥火」下，Kyle鼓起勇氣追問Yvette：「咁你又同 Oswald 食飯？」這個問題似乎觸動了Yvette內心深處，她一時口窒窒，嘆了一口大氣後竟突然情緒崩潰，當場扁嘴兼雙眼通紅，Kyle見狀亦立即別過臉，似乎強忍淚水。Yvette抹著眼淚哽咽說：「我好少可有一個，唔好講朋友／密友，好少有人喺我身邊咁多年…有好多事都會互相分享。」事後她向製作組補充，坦言害怕失去這位摯友：「一段關係可以 hold up 到咁耐，其實係好 touched 嘅一件事，所有愛情我覺得都係脆弱同埋有個時限，既然我同佢可以 last 到咁耐，我唔想可能因為大家有感情咗之後就冇咗。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14106392766ae804cba364e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14106392766ae804cba364e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_15900068976ae804cfa4fd3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_15900068976ae804cfa4fd3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Kyle首揭大學已心動 哽咽自爆因自卑卻步</h2>\n<p>看到Yvette為自己落淚，Kyle亦大為感觸，坦承分享了當年不敢追求女方的原因：「我覺得嗰時我仲係一個小朋友，我覺得 Yvette 係一個需要人照顧嘅人，我覺得我嗰時大學生，乜都冇，乜都仲爭取緊，我畀唔到一個…唔知哩！」事後Kyle接受訪問時，重提當年的自卑感再次忍不住哽咽，言談間充滿遺憾：「人係會慢慢慢慢行埋，但唔知點解就會慢慢慢慢行得疏遠」、「開始一段感情前，我好多時都好卻步，都會問自己可唔可以畀到啲嘢人先至開始…所以一直同陳星妤嘅呢段關係，我唔敢再提起，我唔敢再…正面咁去面對。」節目更曝光二人大量昔日合照，青澀模樣見證著這段錯過的感情。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到眼濕濕力撐 「說中好多男人心底話」</h2>\n<p>這段虐心的「友達以上」關係曝光後，引爆網民熱烈討論，不少人都被二人的真情流露所感動，紛紛留言希望他們能修成正果。「好寫實，往往就係想好好保護一份友好關係，唔想冒險」、「好真實，初出茅廬憑咩下承諾，在旁守護才是真心好」、「一唔一齊都好，Keep 到做好朋友係好事」、「今集對 Kyle 完全改觀，佢說中咗好多男人嘅心底話：『當年自己乜都未有，點畀到她幸福』，Kyle 唔好諗太多，可能女神一直等你行前一步，加油」、「Kyle 段心底話令人聽得好心疼」、「今晚最感動，so far 他們兩個係咁多集以來最真誠嘅表達！當那刻 Yvette 喊嘅時候，我看到 Kyle 心裏都好有感覺」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_557773416ae8050643adb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/34_557773416ae8050643adb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_8336195326ae80509259c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_8336195326ae80509259c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_17680431706ae8050bdb60d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_17680431706ae8050bdb60d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37a_13654846246ae8050ea2cf4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37a_13654846246ae8050ea2cf4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37c_18623784996ae805113f3fa.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37c_18623784996ae805113f3fa.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37b_13943435136ae8051546121.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37b_13943435136ae8051546121.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_7715033576ae805185009c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_7715033576ae805185009c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_595816766ae8051b4beb7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_595816766ae8051b4beb7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_5832830236ae8051eba4a5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_5832830236ae8051eba4a5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>（圖片來源：TVB）\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.483523+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1686,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:07.004194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:09.939105+00:00","content_hash":"20fbf55d10dbd4238637d0760e411691cb5debdbb7a56665f25105fbb13f33cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}